		// A 0.00 here does not lower a unit's share, it removes its ROLE from the
		// plant: CFactoryManager::GetFacRoleDef only collects candidates with
		// probs[i] > 0, and a gantry has one def per role, so the role resolves to
		// null and every consumer that asks by role -- the opener and the quota --
		// skips it silently. armlun 0.00 on land was Armada's only skirmish-role T3;
		// armraz 0.00 in water its only riot-role one.
